  <!-- EN: graser cannon complex -->
  <VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.label>固定式广域射线炮</VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.label>
  <!-- EN: A devastating gamma ray laser mounted on a barricade to grant cover. It fires a sweeping beam capable of piercing armor and igniting targets. Needs to be manned in order to fire. Requires plasteel to refurbish its emitter array after heavy use. -->
  <VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.description>一种固定在路障上的广域射线炮。它可以扫出一束高能射线，穿透厚厚的护甲并灼烧目标。必须有人手动操纵。路障能为射击者提供良好的掩护效果。长期使用后需要大量的玻璃钢维护炮管。</VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.description>
  <!-- EN: Barrel durability -->
  <VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>炮管耐久度</VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shots until barrel change -->
  <VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>更换炮管前剩余射击次数</VFES_Complex_GraserCannon.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
